  "body": "### Before submitting your bug report\n\n- [x] I've tried using the \"Ask AI\" feature on the [Continue docs site](https://docs.continue.dev/) to see if the docs have an answer\n- [x] I believe this is a bug. I'll try to join the [Continue Discord](https://discord.gg/NWtdYexhMs) for questions\n- [x] I'm not able to find an [open issue](https://github.com/continuedev/continue/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue) that reports the same bug\n- [x] I've seen the [troubleshooting guide](https://docs.continue.dev/troubleshooting) on the Continue Docs\n\n### Relevant environment info\n\n```Markdown\n- OS:\n- Continue version:1.0.46, has affected many previous versions\n- IDE version:  IntelliJ IDEA 2025.2.1 (Ultimate Edition), has affected many previous versions\n- Model: Claude, but any.\n```\n\n### Description\n\nIntelliJ crashes about 3-4 times a day on a set of Mac / PC endpoints. \n\nWindow in IJ freezes, like so:\n\n<img width=\"571\" height=\"1229\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9155575-6763-4eff-9d10-5e12e6d59c25\" />\n\nNo keyboard / mouse input to Continue until IJ is restarted fully (not just individual window)\n\n### To reproduce\n\n_No response_\n\n### Log output\n\n```Shell\nNo log output\n```",
